<title>MEXICO: Banco de Mexico to drain 6.632 billion pesos.</title>
<headline>Banco de Mexico to drain 6.632 billion pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Banco de Mexico sought to drain 6.632 billion pesos from the secondary market on Tuesday, dealers said, but added no further details were available.</p>
<p>((--Mexico City newsroom +525 728-9559))</p>
</text>
